  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aceli Zambia - Capital Developmental Expenditure Limit aligned.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to increase private sector lending for small- and medium-enterprises (SMEs) in the agricultural sector. Offering financial incentives to lenders to share in the risk and defray the transaction costs of serving agri-SMEs that can facilitate market access and improve livelihoods for smallholder farmers, create jobs in value-added processing, promote adoption of climate resilient practices, and strengthen food security and nutrition for a growing population across the continent.</narrative>
  </description>
